<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#fff0f5">

  <title>Our Little Love World ♡</title>

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>

  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;1,500&family=Dancing+Script:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>

<body>

  <!-- PASSWORD SCREEN -->
  <div id="lockScreen">
    <div class="lock-card">

      <div class="lock-bow">🎀</div>

      <p class="eyebrow">A PRIVATE LITTLE WORLD</p>

      <h1>Hey, Samrath!</h1>

      <p>
        Someone made a tiny universe just for you.
        <br>
        Enter the secret password to unlock it. ♡
      </p>

      <input
        type="password"
        id="passwordInput"
        placeholder="Our secret password..."
      >

      <button class="primary-btn" id="unlockBtn">
        Unlock my world ♡
      </button>

      <p id="error"></p>

      <span class="lock-footer">୨୧ Made with love ୨୧</span>

    </div>
  </div>


  <!-- MAIN WEBSITE -->
  <div id="website">

    <!-- NAVIGATION -->
    <nav>

      <div class="logo">Our Love World ♡</div>

      <button class="menu-toggle" id="menuToggle" aria-label="Toggle menu">
        ☰
      </button>

      <div class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#letter">Letter</a>
        <a href="#story">Our Story</a>
        <a href="#reasons">100 Reasons</a>
        <a href="#gallery">Gallery</a>
        <a href="#quiz">Quiz</a>
        <a href="#secret">Secret</a>
      </div>

    </nav>


    <!-- HOME -->
    <section class="hero" id="home">

      <span class="floating-decor decor-one">♡</span>
      <span class="floating-decor decor-two">🎀</span>
      <span class="floating-decor decor-three">✧</span>
      <span class="floating-decor decor-four">♥</span>

      <div class="hero-content">

        <p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE SOMETHING FOR MY FAVOURITE PERSON</p>

        <h1>Hey, My Bebee! ♡</h1>

        <h2>Welcome to our little universe.</h2>

        <p class="hero-description">
          A tiny corner of the internet where everything is pink n white,
          everything is cute, and everything reminds me of you.
          This little world belongs to you. Just you. ♡
        </p>

        <a href="#letter" class="primary-btn">
          Open your surprise 💌
        </a>

        <p class="handwritten">
          You + Me = My favourite little story ୨୧
        </p>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- LOVE LETTER -->
    <section class="section letter-section" id="letter">

      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">SOMETHING FROM MY HEART</p>
        <h2>A Letter For You 💌</h2>
        <p>Because some feelings deserve their own little page.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="letter-card">

        <div class="letter-decoration">💗 🎀 💗</div>

        <h3>My dearest Samrat,</h3>

        <p>
          I don't really know where to begin, because how do I put
          someone like you into a few paragraphs?
        </p>

        <p>
          It's funny how two people can cross paths through random
          Instagram group chats and somehow become so important
          to each other. I never knew that a chaotic conversation
          could turn into something I would want to keep close.
        </p>

        <p>
          I love the way you express yourself, the way you play
          with words, your songs, your shayari and that voice of yours.
          Sometimes I wonder how one person can be so full of words
          and still leave me speechless.
        </p>

        <p>
          I may tease you, annoy you, act dramatic and demand
          attention like a tiny spoiled child, but somewhere
          between all that, you've become someone very special
          to me.
        </p>

        <p>
          I don't want a perfect story. I want something real.
          Something where we can laugh at silly things, talk about
          absolutely nothing, understand each other and keep choosing
          each other even on ordinary days.
        </p>

        <p>
          So here's a little reminder: you are appreciated,
          you are cared for, and you deserve all the softness
          this world can offer.
        </p>

        <p>
          And if you ever forget how special you are,
          come back to this little website. I'll leave a little
          piece of my affection here for you. ♡
        </p>

        <div class="signature">
          Yours, your little babygirl ♡
        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- OUR STORY -->
    <section class="section story-section" id="story">

      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">IT STARTED SOMEWHERE</p>
        <h2>Our Little Story ୨୧</h2>
        <p>Not a perfect fairytale. Just our own little chaotic/funny/lovey beginning.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="timeline">

        <article class="timeline-item">
          <span class="memory-tag">The beginning</span>
          <h3>Two strangers, one group chat</h3>
          <p>
            We first crossed paths through an Instagram group chat.
            Just another random interaction that neither of us knew
            would become part of our story.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
          <span class="memory-tag">Another chapter</span>
          <h3>Crossing paths again</h3>
          <p>
            Somehow, our paths crossed again in another group.
            And this time, the conversations turned out differently.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
          <span class="memory-tag">Getting closer</span>
          <h3>Words, songs and shayari</h3>
          <p>
            Slowly, we started getting to know each other.
            Your way with words, songs and shayari became
            little things I associate with you.
          </p>
        </article>
 <article class="timeline-item">
    <span class="memory-tag">Trust issues unlocked 🥲</span>
    <h3>Not everything was rosy</h3>
    <p>
      We had our share of fights, misunderstandings and
      trust issues. Sometimes things got complicated,
      sometimes words hurt, and sometimes understanding
      each other felt harder than it should have.
      But our story wasn't ready to end there.
    </p>
  </article>

  <article class="timeline-item">
    <span class="memory-tag">The legendary triangle 😭</span>
    <h3>You, me and Tanu!</h3>
    <p>
      And then came the chapter nobody could forget:
      the whole you-me-and-Tanu triangle!
      A little too much confusion, a lot of emotions,
      and definitely more drama than our story needed.
    </p>
  </article>

  <article class="timeline-item">
    <span class="memory-tag">GC courtroom ⚖️</span>
    <h3>When the entire GC got involved</h3>
    <p>
      As if our own kalesh wasn't enough, the entire
      group chat got involved too! Opinions, discussions,
      arguments, explanations and endless drama.
      At some point, it felt like our personal story
      had become the group's biggest episode.
    </p>
  </article>

  <article class="timeline-item">
    <span class="memory-tag">The emotional chapter 🥺</span>
    <h3>Rona-dhona and everything in between</h3>
    <p>
      There were tears, emotional conversations,
      overthinking, misunderstandings and moments
      when things felt uncertain.
      We weren't perfect, and neither was our journey.
      But every chapter became a part of our story.
    </p>
  </article>

  <article class="timeline-item">
    <span class="memory-tag">Finally, us! 💗</span>
    <h3>After all that, you became mine</h3>
    <p>
      After all the kalesh, confusion, trust issues,
      GC drama and emotional rollercoaster rides...
      here we are.
      Finally, you and me. Together.
      And honestly, this is the chapter I want to keep.
    </p>
  </article>

  <article class="timeline-item">
    <span class="memory-tag">Our forever ♾️</span>
    <h3>Not just a chapter, a lifetime!</h3>
    <p>
      I don't want this to be just another temporary
      chapter in our lives. I want more conversations,
      more laughter, more silly fights, more making up,
      more memories and more of US.
      <br><br>
      Through every high and low, I hope we keep
      choosing each other.
      <br><br>
      Finally, Sami, you're mine and I'm yours.
      Now let's make this ours, not just for today,
      but for always. ♡
    </p>
  </article>

</div>
        <article class="timeline-item">
          <span class="memory-tag">Right now</span>
          <h3>A little world for Sami</h3>
          <p>
            And now there's this tiny website, made with love,
            just to remind you that you're someone special to me.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
          <span class="memory-tag">To be continued...</span>
          <h3>More chapters to come ♡</h3>
          <p>
            We still have so many pages left to write.
            Let's make them ours, one little moment at a time.
          </p>
        </article>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- 100 REASONS -->
    <section class="section reasons-section" id="reasons">

      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">A HUNDRED LITTLE THINGS</p>
        <h2>100 Reasons I Adore You 💗</h2>
        <p>One reason at a time. Infinite affection.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="reason-card">

        <p id="reasonCount" class="reason-count">REASON 01 OF 100</p>

        <div id="reasonNumber" class="reason-number">01</div>

        <p id="reasonText" class="reason-text"></p>

        <div class="reason-controls">
          <button class="secondary-btn" id="previousReason">← Previous</button>
          <button class="primary-btn" id="nextReason">Next →</button>
        </div>

        <p class="little-note">P.S. I could write a thousand more. ♡</p>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- PHOTO GALLERY -->
    <section class="section gallery-section" id="gallery">

      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">LITTLE PIECES OF US</p>
        <h2>Our Cute Little Gallery 📸</h2>
        <p>Some spaces are waiting for your favourite pictures.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gallery">

        <div class="photo-card">
          <img src="https://files.catbox.moe/9fhhfk.jpg" alt="Our first picture">
          <p>My favourite person ♡</p>
        </div>

        <div class="photo-card">
          <img src="https://files.catbox.moe/razpbr.jpg" alt="Our second picture">
          <p>Cutest human 🎀</p>
        </div>

        <div class="photo-card">
          <img src="https://files.catbox.moe/zj7ixu.jpg" alt="Our third picture">
          <p>Little happiness 💗</p>
        </div>

        <div class="photo-card">
          <img src="https://files.catbox.moe/zj7ixu.jpg" alt="Our fourth picture">
          <p>My Sami ♡</p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <p class="gallery-note">
        Tap any picture to see it bigger. Replace these sample paths
        with your own photographs.
      </p>

    </section>


    <!-- PHOTO LIGHTBOX -->
    <div class="lightbox" id="lightbox">
      <button id="closeLightbox" aria-label="Close photo">×</button>
      <img id="lightboxImage" src="" alt="Enlarged gallery picture">
    </div>


    <!-- QUIZ -->
    <section class="section quiz-section" id="quiz">

      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">LET'S SEE HOW WELL YOU KNOW US</p>
        <h2>How Well Do You Know Me? 🎮</h2>
        <p>Answer these little questions, Mr. Samrat!</p>
      </div>

      <div class="quiz-card">

        <div id="quizArea">
          <p id="questionNumber" class="question-number"></p>
          <h3 id="questionText" class="quiz-question"></h3>
          <div id="options" class="quiz-options"></div>
          <p id="quizFeedback" class="quiz-feedback"></p>
        </div>

        <div id="quizResult" class="quiz-result hidden"></div>

        <button id="restartQuiz" class="primary-btn hidden">
          Play again ♡
        </button>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- SECRET ROOM -->
    <section class="section secret-section" id="secret">

      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">ONLY FOR YOU</p>
        <h2>A Little Secret Room 🤫</h2>
        <p>There's a message hidden here, waiting for you.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="secret-box">

        <div class="secret-icon">💌</div>

        <h3>One last little thing...</h3>

        <p>
          Sami, there's a message waiting for you.
          Are you ready?
        </p>

        <button id="revealSecret" class="primary-btn">
          Reveal my secret ♡
        </button>

        <div id="secretMessage" class="secret-message hidden">

          <h3>Listen, you! 🎀</h3>

          <p>
            If I could send you one thing through this screen,
            it would be the biggest hug ever.
          </p>

          <p>
            Thank you for being my little world.
            Don't forget to smile, take care of yourself,
            drink water and remember that someone is cheering
            for you. ♡
          </p>

          <p class="handwritten">
            Now give me a virtual hug! 🫂
          </p>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- RANDOM SURPRISE -->
    <section class="section surprise-section">

      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">A TINY SURPRISE</p>
        <h2>Feeling Lucky, Samrat? 💝</h2>
        <p>Click the button. Your little surprise is waiting.</p>
      </div>

      <button id="surpriseBtn" class="primary-btn">
        Give me a surprise! 🎀
      </button>

      <p id="surpriseMessage" class="surprise-message">
        Waiting for you, silly ♡
      </p>

    </section>


    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer>

      <div class="footer-heart">♡</div>

      Made with love, pink hearts and a little bit of craziness.

      <p>This little world belongs to Sami. 🎀</p>

      <p class="footer-script">Forever a little love story ♡</p>

    </footer>

  </div>


  <!-- MUSIC PLAYER -->
  <div id="musicPlayer" class="music-player hidden">

    <button id="musicButton" aria-label="Play music">▶</button>

    <div class="music-info">
      <span id="musicLabel">A song for you ♡</span>
      <small>Just for Sami</small>
    </div>

  </div>

  <audio id="backgroundMusic" loop preload="none">
    <source src="https://files.catbox.moe/tq5pl0.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
    Your browser does not support audio.
  </audio>


  <script src="script.js"></script>

</body>
</html>


:root {
  --pink: #f7b8cc;
  --dark-pink: #df789e;
  --light-pink: #fff0f5;
  --cream: #fffafd;
  --text: #704656;
  --muted: #a47d8c;
  --white: #ffffff;
}

* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

html {
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

button, a {
  font-family: inherit;
}

button {
  cursor: pointer;
}

a {
  text-decoration: none;
  color: inherit;
}

.hidden {
  display: none !important;
}

/* BUTTONS */

.primary-btn,
.secondary-btn {
  display: inline-block;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 40px;
  padding: 13px 25px;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
  transition: .3s ease;
}

.primary-btn {
  background: var(--dark-pink);
  color: white;
  box-shadow: 0 6px 18px #df789e30;
}

.secondary-btn {
  background: #fff0f5;
  color: var(--dark-pink);
  border: 1px solid #f2c6d6;
}

.primary-btn:hover,
.secondary-btn:hover {
  transform: translateY(-3px);
}

/* PASSWORD */

#lockScreen {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 1000;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 20px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffe4ed, #fff8fb, #fbd5e2);
}

.lock-card {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 420px;
  background: #ffffffdd;
  padding: 45px 30px;
  border-radius: 30px;
  text-align: center;
  border: 1px solid white;
  box-shadow: 0 15px 50px #d987a533;
}

.lock-bow {
  font-size: 55px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.lock-card h1 {
  font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive;
  font-size: 48px;
  color: var(--dark-pink);
  margin: 12px 0;
}

.lock-card > p:not(.eyebrow) {
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.8;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.lock-card input {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 15px;
  background: #fff8fb;
  border: 1px solid #f4c3d3;
  border-radius: 15px;
  outline: none;
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--text);
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.lock-card input:focus {
  border-color: var(--dark-pink);
}

.lock-card .primary-btn {
  width: 100%;
}

.lock-footer {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 25px;
  color: #d98ba8;
}

#error {
  color: #d44d79;
  font-size: 13px;
  margin-top: 12px;
  min-height: 18px;
}

/* NAVIGATION */

nav {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 100;
  background: #ffffffed;
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 15px 7%;
  box-shadow: 0 3px 20px #d987a51a;
}

.logo {
  font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive;
  font-size: 29px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--dark-pink);
}

.nav-links {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 19px;
}

.nav-links a {
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 700;
  transition: .2s;
}

.nav-links a:hover {
  color: var(--dark-pink);
}

.menu-toggle {
  display: none;
  border: none;
  background: #fff0f5;
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 8px 12px;
  color: var(--dark-pink);
  font-size: 20px;
}

/* HERO */

.hero {
  min-height: 85vh;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffe6ef, #fff8fb, #fbd8e5);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  text-align: center;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  padding: 70px 20px;
}

.hero-content {
  max-width: 750px;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
}

.eyebrow {
  color: #bc7892;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

.hero h1 {
  font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive;
  font-size: clamp(55px, 9vw, 90px);
  color: var(--dark-pink);
  margin: 20px 0;
}

.hero h2 {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: clamp(19px, 4vw, 28px);
  font-weight: 500;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}

.hero-description {
  max-width: 560px;
  margin: auto;
  color: #936879;
  line-height: 1.9;
  font-size: 15px;
}

.hero-content .primary-btn {
  margin-top: 28px;
}

.handwritten {
  font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive;
  font-size: 27px;
  color: var(--dark-pink);
  margin-top: 28px;
}

.floating-decor {
  position: absolute;
  color: #e99ab5;
  opacity: .55;
  animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
}

.decor-one {
  top: 12%;
  left: 12%;
  font-size: 55px;
}

.decor-two {
  bottom: 15%;
  right: 12%;
  font-size: 45px;
  animation-delay: 1s;
}

.decor-three {
  top: 25%;
  right: 15%;
  font-size: 30px;
  animation-delay: 2s;
}

.decor-four {
  bottom: 20%;
  left: 15%;
  font-size: 35px;
  animation-delay: 1.5s;
}

@keyframes float {
  0%, 100% {
    transform: translateY(0) rotate(-5deg);
  }
  50% {
    transform: translateY(-18px) rotate(7deg);
  }
}

/* COMMON SECTIONS */

.section {
  padding: 80px 8%;
  scroll-margin-top: 75px;
}

.section-heading {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 45px;
}

.section-heading h2 {
  font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive;
  font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 58px);
  color: var(--dark-pink);
  margin: 10px 0;
}

.section-heading > p:last-child {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

/* LETTER */

.letter-section {
  background: #fff8fb;
}

.letter-card {
  max-width: 760px;
  margin: auto;
  background: white;
  border: 1px solid #f5d4df;
  padding: 45px;
  border-radius: 25px;
  box-shadow: 0 12px 35px #d987a51c;
}

.letter-decoration {
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 35px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.letter-card h3 {
  font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive;
  color: var(--dark-pink);
  font-size: 38px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.letter-card p {
  line-height: 2;
  font-size: 15px;
  margin-bottom: 17px;
  color: #765262;
}

.signature {
  font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive;
  font-size: 29px;
  color: var(--dark-pink);
  text-align: right;
  margin-top: 25px;
}

/* STORY */

.story-section {
  background: white;
}

.timeline {
  max-width: 700px;
  margin: auto;
  border-left: 2px dashed #edabc1;
  padding-left: 30px;
}

.timeline-item {
  position: relative;
  margin-bottom: 38px;
}

.timeline-item::before {
  content: "♡";
  position: absolute;
  left: -44px;
  top: 0;
  width: 27px;
  height: 27px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #fff0f5;
  color: var(--dark-pink);
}

.memory-tag {
  display: inline-block;
  background: #fff0f5;
  padding: 6px 13px;
  border-radius: 30px;
  color: var(--dark-pink);
  font-size: 11px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.timeline-item h3 {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  color: var(--dark-pink);
  margin-bottom: 9px;
  font-size: 21px;
}

.timeline-item p {
  line-height: 1.9;
  color: #947281;
  font-size: 14px;
}

/* REASONS */

.reasons-section {
  background: #fff4f8;
}

.reason-card {
  max-width: 570px;
  margin: auto;
  background: white;
  border-radius: 30px;
  padding: 45px 25px;
  text-align: center;
  box-shadow: 0 10px 35px #d987a51c;
}

.reason-count {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: #bd8a9c;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
}

.reason-number {
  font-family: 'Dancing Script', cursive;
  font-size: 75px;
  color: var(--dark-pink);
  margin: 10px;
}

.reason-text {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 21px;
